"usage: firefly-reports [-h] [--version] [--url URL] [--token TOKEN] [--lang {en,it}] [--debug] [--debug-file PATH] <command> ... Firefly III -> PDF + Excel reports and plain-text ledger export. positional arguments: <command> report Generate the PDF + Excel reports from a Firefly III instance export Export transactions to a plain-text ledger (beancount) init Create ./firefly-reports.toml interactively demo Generate every report from built-in sample data (no Firefly III needed) options: -h, --help show this help message and exit --version show program's version number and exit --url URL Firefly III base URL --token TOKEN Personal Access Token --lang {en,it} Language of the output (default: en) --debug Enable debug log to file --debug-file PATH Log file path (default: <out>/debug_<timestamp>.log) examples: firefly-reports report --year 2025 --owner \"Mario Rossi\" firefly-reports export beancount --scaffold firefly-reports demo --out ./output Credentials may also come from FIREFLY_URL / FIREFLY_TOKEN, a .env file or ./firefly-reports.toml. Run 'firefly-reports <command> --help' for the options of a command."
